Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:02:02.23,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(3300,480)\pos(930,750)\fnDream Han Serif SC W27\c&H743000&\3c&HFAFBFA&\bord6\blur2\fs90\fsp5}小书痴的下克{\fsp0}上\N{\fs30\bord4\fnFZLanTingYuan-DB-GBK\fsp5\blur1}为了成为图书管理员不择手{\fsp0}段\N{\fnDream Han Serif SC W18\fscx90\fsp15\fs70\c&HD79712&\bord5\blur2}领主的养{\fsp0}女
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.89,0:01:58.85,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}在只差一步时跌倒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.85,0:02:02.52,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,以为到极限而消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.52,0:02:04.52,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,但我依然坚持前行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.52,0:02:08.32,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不甘心就这样结束
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:11.28,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只要闭上双眼想象
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.32,0:02:11.28,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(106,565,\blur2)\t(565,815,\blur0)}只要闭上{\alpha&HFF&}双眼想象
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:15.37,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,总能看见你在身旁
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.28,0:02:15.37,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(66,400,\blur2)\t(400,858,\blur0)}总能看见{\alpha&HFF&}你在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.37,0:02:20.33,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,面带我最爱的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.33,0:02:22.62,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:26.50,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,故事还在进行之中
Dialogue: 1,0:02:22.62,0:02:26.50,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0\t(2980,3355,\blur3)\t(3355,3772,\blur0)}故事还在进行之中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.50,0:02:28.92,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,安静一点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:32.88,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,让我们翻开下一页
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:36.14,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,不用担心我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:39.81,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,只因心中时刻有你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.81,0:02:42.93,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,总能听见你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:44.69,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,让我变得更加坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:48.11,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,就算觉得坚持不住
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.11,0:02:51.86,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,忍不住要流下眼泪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.86,0:02:54.95,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,总能听见你的助威
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.95,0:02:57.91,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,我一直都感觉良好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.91,0:03:00.87,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,绝对不会轻言放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.87,0:03:07.04,OPCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(5700,6180,\alpha&HC8&)}爱的力量多么神奇
Comment: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ending
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.33,0:21:50.42,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)}就算身处遥远又未知的星球
Dialogue: 1,0:21:50.42,0:21:54.54,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,仰望着头顶的那片陌生的天空
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.54,0:21:58.51,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,就算深爱过的人和许下的诺言
Dialogue: 1,0:21:58.51,0:22:01.76,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,还有其他的一切都不在手边
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:06.76,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&HFF&\t(750,1810,\alpha&H00&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}我依然记忆犹新
Dialogue: 1,0:22:01.76,0:22:06.76,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我依然记忆犹新
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.89,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}时间之海默默记录着你的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:22:06.76,0:22:09.89,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,时间之海默默记录着你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:17.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\t(690,1840,\alpha&HFF&)\3c&HB5C2BF&\bord6\blur4}你轻轻推开了沉没在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.89,0:22:17.07,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,你轻轻推开了沉没在海中的
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.07,0:22:19.19,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,那扇门
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.90,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1100,0)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.19,0:22:20.90,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Wanna me Wanna me Wanna me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:24.99,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}在别人对我有所认知之前
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.90,0:22:24.99,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,在别人对我有所认知之前
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.99,0:22:27.29,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}我实际上
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.99,0:22:27.29,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,我实际上
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.29,0:22:29.12,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1840)\3c&HBED6CA&\bord6\blur4}Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.29,0:22:29.12,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,Gonna me Gonna me Gonna me
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.12,0:22:32.08,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,对自己有清楚的认知
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.08,0:22:35.46,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,独自一人也没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.46,0:22:37.25,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1810,0)\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}随着季节更替
Dialogue: 1,0:22:35.46,0:22:37.25,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,随着季节更替
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.25,0:22:43.59,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HACA69C&\bord6\blur4}与互相拥抱取暖的某人相遇又离别
Dialogue: 1,0:22:37.25,0:22:43.59,EDCN2,,0,0,0,,与互相拥抱取暖的某人相遇又离别
